# Ad campaigns — business accounts, placements, pricing

Design notes only (not FloqAi help). Resume: `@ad-campaigns$` / `$ads$`. Current: **s3.1.0** (paid ads, Ad Management, measurement, SMS/WhatsApp intake).

## Placement types (product categories)

| Type | Code | Where shown | Attention |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Inline** | `placementType: "inline"` | Feature flow interstitials (Search category/Mingl entry splash, RydR step, club CTA splash, Mingl people-grid cards) | High — interrupts a job |
| **Mingl Gist** | `placementType: "minglGist"` | Mingl Gist story ring / scroll feed only | Medium — native in scroll |

Slots map:

- Inline → `["default","clubs","events","lounges","lounge-club","shoutout","rydr","mingl"]` (not exclusive to mingl-gist)
- Mingl Gist → `["mingl-gist","mingl"]`

